22. QUICK DISPLAY REFERENCE
============================================================

INLINE

display: inline;

- stays in text flow
- normally does not start new line
- width/height generally do not behave like block sizing


BLOCK

display: block;

- starts on new line
- accepts width
- accepts height


INLINE-BLOCK

